#   span   a range of intermediate-present VBLs, two apart; every VBL of it
#          but the first is a leg, compared with the capture two VBLs earlier
# Walking on the reflective ice: keyframe advances on legs 1905 + 8k, avatar
# and mirrored copy.
icy-peak-reflective-mirror.bk2 | 1901-2019
# Portal entry: walking, then the entry glide.
sunrise-spring-sunny-villa-portal-entry.bk2 | 1541-1599
# Held camera cuts after the portal entry: legs 1927 and 2493 hold the cut at
# alpha 0 and end on the tick at alpha 1.
sunrise-spring-sunny-villa-portal-entry.bk2 | 1919-1935,2485-2501
